<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Tobacco Co. 1996 profits rise.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Tobacco Co. 1996 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Nigerian Tobacco Company to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Turnover		    1,600	 1,400</p>
<p>Profit before taxation     280.4	 172.9</p>
<p>Taxation			  28.3	  53.9</p>
<p> Profit after taxation     252	   119</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
